  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAJPM Luanda - Community Participation and Citizenship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	To realise a needs assessment in three communities to identify the real needs and priorities and to develop a plan of action based on this.
2.	To support the development and strengthening of three community groups who will coordinate local development actions. 
3.	Plus a fourth coordinating group that will represent all three communities for advocacy purposes.
4.	Strengthen the capacity of the three technical staff working to implement this project.</narrative>
  </description>
